2.f. Define Each Term:
```
        a. Clone:       Copying the files from GitHub to your computer.

        b. Commit:      Marking changes in the code with a message.

        c. Push:        Moving your changes to GitHub.

        d. Branch:      Copy of the main repository that lets you make changes without affecting the main branch.

        e. Pull:        Taking changes from another computer so it can be merged.

        f. Pull Request: Requesting for your changes to be added to the repository.

